### Create a company
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Google",
  "location": "Seattle, WA",
  "website": "google.com",
  "industry": "Technology"
}

###

### Create a job listing for company 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/job-listings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Backend Developer",
  "description": "Java backend role",
  "salaryMin": 90000,
  "salaryMax": 120000,
  "listingStatus": "OPEN",
  "datePosted": "2026-02-01"
}

###

### Create a contact for company 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Smith",
  "title": "Engineering Manager",
  "email": "john.smith@google.com",
  "phoneNumber": "425-555-1234"
}

###

### Create application without contact
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateApplied": "2026-02-15",
  "notes": "Applied through LinkedIn",
  "applicationStatus": "APPLIED"
}

###

### Try to create duplicate application - should throw error
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateApplied": "2026-02-15",
  "notes": "Duplicate attempt",
  "applicationStatus": "APPLIED"
}

###

### Create second listing and application with contact
POST http://localhost:8080/api/job-listings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior Engineer",
  "description": "Senior Java role",
  "salaryMin": 130000,
  "salaryMax": 160000,
  "listingStatus": "OPEN",
  "datePosted": "2026-01-15"
}

###

POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications/2?contactId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateApplied": "2026-02-20",
  "notes": "Referred by John Smith",
  "applicationStatus": "APPLIED"
}

###

### Get all applications
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications

###

### Get application by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1

###

### Update application status via PATCH
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

"PHONE_SCREEN"

###

### Verify status update
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1

###

### Update full application
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1?contactId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateApplied": "2026-02-15",
  "notes": "Updated notes after phone screen",
  "applicationStatus": "INTERVIEW"
}

###

### Delete application
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/applications/2